{
  "$schema": "https://speculum.local/schemas/tokens.v1.json",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Speculum design tokens",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "notes": [
      "Single source of truth for M3. tools/gen-tokens.mjs generates CSS + Rust from this file.",
      "ACCENT ADJUSTMENT (contrast): spec draft listed accent.primary #5B8CFF (dark) / #2F6BFF (light) with white accent.on. Measured WCAG ratios: dark 3.16:1 (fails 4.5), light 4.50:1 (borderline). Darkened slightly for AA: dark #5B8CFF -> #3B69FF (4.52:1), light #2F6BFF -> #2B64F5 (4.95:1). Same blue hue family, noted per milestone instructions."
    ]
  },
